(No need to train anymore)

1353
00:48:53,690 --> 00:48:54,650
(Scary strong)

1354
00:48:56,710 --> 00:48:58,310
I'm attacked on both sides right now.

1355
00:48:59,450 --> 00:49:01,010
(Unmoved)

1356
00:49:01,130 --> 00:49:03,170
(Sneak attack from behind failed)

1357
00:49:03,430 --> 00:49:04,910
Where's Mr. Huang's finger?

1358
00:49:04,910 --> 00:49:07,070
Right behind you. Move a bit.

1359
00:49:08,510 --> 00:49:09,590
I can't reach it.

1360
00:49:11,250 --> 00:49:13,010
(Attack again)

1361
00:49:15,930 --> 00:49:18,010
(Facing enemies on three sides)

1362
00:49:20,250 --> 00:49:21,850
(Smooth escape)

1363
00:49:23,830 --> 00:49:25,230
He shoved his hand into your pocket.

1364
00:49:27,350 --> 00:49:28,270
This is insane.

1365
00:49:31,350 --> 00:49:31,950
Churan.

1366
00:49:31,950 --> 00:49:33,670
Let me rescue you first, come on.

1367
00:49:34,710 --> 00:49:35,510
I'll...

1368
00:49:36,190 --> 00:49:37,070
get Mr. Huang off.

1369
00:49:37,070 --> 00:49:38,830
Get Mr. Huang off, and I'll believe you.

1370
00:49:38,930 --> 00:49:40,890
(Rushing into the VIP "private table"
to watch)

1371
00:49:42,610 --> 00:49:44,010
(Oh my)

1372
00:49:44,030 --> 00:49:45,430
I can't push him.

1373
00:49:46,690 --> 00:49:47,850
(Unmoved)

1374
00:49:47,850 --> 00:49:49,610
(Top-tier defense)

1375
00:49:51,930 --> 00:49:53,770
(Drained of all energy)

1376
00:49:55,550 --> 00:49:56,310
You can't even get up,

1377
00:49:56,310 --> 00:49:57,590
and you want Churan to push him away?

1378
00:49:57,750 --> 00:49:58,550
I haven't even fought back yet.

1379
00:49:58,550 --> 00:49:59,670
I was scared Mr. Huang might get hurt.

1380
00:50:01,490 --> 00:50:02,810
(Go ahead and fight back)

1381
00:50:10,230 --> 00:50:10,990
Mr. Huang, truce.

1382
00:50:11,350 --> 00:50:12,230
Truce?

1383
00:50:12,230 --> 00:50:13,350
I'll switch from the feet side.

1384
00:50:15,570 --> 00:50:16,570
(Fingers off the ground)

1385
00:50:19,530 --> 00:50:21,410
(Glutes putting in work again)

1386
00:50:22,830 --> 00:50:23,470
He got up.

1387
00:50:26,170 --> 00:50:27,570
(Huang Jingyu out)

1388
00:50:30,010 --> 00:50:31,890
(Got some real glute power)

1389
00:50:38,010 --> 00:50:39,530
(Another cool moment)

1390
00:50:39,550 --> 00:50:40,110
This pal

1391
00:50:40,110 --> 00:50:42,230
is studying military strategy now.

1392
00:50:44,070 --> 00:50:44,990
What's the play, Bai?

1393
00:50:45,870 --> 00:50:46,790
You two lost, though.

1394
00:50:47,630 --> 00:50:48,550
I'm still alive.

1395
00:50:48,550 --> 00:50:49,450
(Didn't you see the scene just now?)

1396
00:50:49,830 --> 00:50:50,590
What he means is,

1397
00:50:50,590 --> 00:50:51,990
he's the strongest one now.

1398
00:50:52,510 --> 00:50:53,830
Come on,
who's getting eliminated first? Come on.

1399
00:50:55,330 --> 00:50:56,890
(Look at you getting all cocky)

1400
00:50:59,210 --> 00:51:00,490
(Bai Jingting's POV)

1401
00:51:00,510 --> 00:51:00,910
Hold on.

1402
00:51:00,910 --> 00:51:01,550
Let me get up first.

1403
00:51:01,550 --> 00:51:02,210
(I can't take this)

1404
00:51:03,610 --> 00:51:04,450
(Staying away from the chaos)

1405
00:51:04,470 --> 00:51:05,870
Hope I'm not
getting in the way of your escape.

1406
00:51:05,970 --> 00:51:07,770
(Watching from the front row)

1407
00:51:08,130 --> 00:51:09,810
(Launching attack)

1408
00:51:09,810 --> 00:51:11,330
(Bai Jingting's POV)

1409
00:51:11,610 --> 00:51:12,530
(Watching from the sidelines)

1410
00:51:14,070 --> 00:51:14,910
How about an alliance?

1411
00:51:15,050 --> 00:51:16,050
(I'm about to finish this,
and you're thinking of allying?)

1412
00:51:16,650 --> 00:51:17,770
(You really got a million tricks)

1413
00:51:18,630 --> 00:51:20,510
Flexible as ever.

1414
00:51:20,510 --> 00:51:21,350
(A role model for us all)
A true hero.

1415
00:51:21,350 --> 00:51:21,630
Seriously.

1416
00:51:21,630 --> 00:51:22,790
Super flexible.

1417
00:51:26,830 --> 00:51:27,990
His hand was still on him.

1418
00:51:27,990 --> 00:51:28,910
How about an alliance?

1419
00:51:29,030 --> 00:51:30,150
Flexible as ever.

1420
00:51:30,750 --> 00:51:32,030
Should we set a strategy?

1421
00:51:32,210 --> 00:51:33,350
(What's he scheming now?)

1422
00:51:33,350 --> 00:51:33,830
What strategy?

1423
00:51:33,830 --> 00:51:34,510
Just like...

1424
00:51:35,190 --> 00:51:35,950
a fair duel,

1425
00:51:35,950 --> 00:51:36,830
and then...

1426
00:51:36,830 --> 00:51:37,710
Do I look like a fool to you?

1427
00:51:37,730 --> 00:51:38,610
(Fool in the eyes of idiot:
the profile pic that shuts the boss up)

1428
00:51:41,090 --> 00:51:42,130
(Sneak attack)

1429
00:51:44,370 --> 00:51:45,330
(Still standing strong)

1430
00:51:45,650 --> 00:51:46,690
(Provoking me?)

1431
00:51:46,730 --> 00:51:47,750
(If that's the case)

1432
00:51:47,750 --> 00:51:48,390
I...

1433
00:51:49,370 --> 00:51:50,690
(Then I won't hold back)

1434
00:51:51,690 --> 00:51:52,730
(Looks like
I picked on the wrong person)

1435
00:51:52,910 --> 00:51:54,010
(Adding fuel to the fire)
Can you really tolerate this?

1436
00:51:55,310 --> 00:51:55,590
Wait.

1437
00:51:55,590 --> 00:51:56,470
Why do your two fingers

1438
00:51:56,470 --> 00:51:58,350
look like they're wearing tights?

1439
00:51:58,350 --> 00:51:59,310
Seriously.

1440
00:52:00,830 --> 00:52:02,390
The key is his face is here too,

1441
00:52:02,390 --> 00:52:03,070
you know?

1442
00:52:03,470 --> 00:52:04,550
Churan, if you're going to do this...

1443
00:52:05,390 --> 00:52:06,150
We can only form an alliance.

1444
00:52:06,150 --> 00:52:06,830
Yeah.

1445
00:52:06,830 --> 00:52:07,870
(From the Wangs' art of war)
We can only form an alliance

1446
00:52:07,870 --> 00:52:08,750
if I do this.

1447
00:52:09,310 --> 00:52:10,870
Gosh, these two.

1448
00:52:10,890 --> 00:52:11,670
(Neither of them is trustworthy)

1449
00:52:11,670 --> 00:52:12,910
Honestly...

1450
00:52:12,970 --> 00:52:14,330
(At last, a kindred spirit
in a desolate place)

1451
00:52:19,110 --> 00:52:20,150
A fair duel, Bai.

1452
00:52:20,150 --> 00:52:21,030
Let's make this exciting.

1453
00:52:21,030 --> 00:52:21,990
Here we go again.

1454
00:52:21,990 --> 00:52:23,650
(He knows it is exciting, but not why)

1455
00:52:23,910 --> 00:52:24,270
Come on.

1456
00:52:24,270 --> 00:52:24,950
Are you sure?

1457
00:52:24,950 --> 00:52:25,350
Come on.

1458
00:52:28,650 --> 00:52:30,690
(Always looking for a chance to strike)

1459
00:52:30,690 --> 00:52:31,890
(Sneaking up from Bai Jingting's
point of view)

1460
00:52:32,670 --> 00:52:33,630
Wait, how...

1461
00:52:33,630 --> 00:52:35,030
How are you everywhere?

1462
00:52:35,030 --> 00:52:37,350
Churan, will you stop lurking around,
waiting for a chance

1463
00:52:37,350 --> 00:52:37,990
to strike?

1464
00:52:38,910 --> 00:52:39,510
Wait.

1465
00:52:39,510 --> 00:52:40,390
Don't you get altitude sickness?

1466
00:52:40,390 --> 00:52:41,710
Go wait over there.

1467
00:52:41,710 --> 00:52:43,430
You said we were going
to make this exciting,

1468
00:52:43,430 --> 00:52:44,350
so she came over.

1469
00:52:44,530 --> 00:52:46,370
(Your "Ran" is here)
[*Excitement]

1470
00:52:48,230 --> 00:52:49,590
Come on.

1471
00:52:50,230 --> 00:52:51,150
(Stay away from Ran)
Where are you going?

1472
00:52:51,410 --> 00:52:52,410
(Let's make this our battlefield)

1473
00:52:54,290 --> 00:52:55,150
(Are you still following me?)

1474
00:52:55,150 --> 00:52:55,550
Wait.

1475
00:52:55,550 --> 00:52:56,310
I am tying my shoes.

1476
00:52:56,950 --> 00:52:58,270
Go tie them over there.

1477
00:52:59,370 --> 00:53:00,850
(Following close behind)

1478
00:53:01,850 --> 00:53:04,010
(One final warning)

1479
00:53:04,270 --> 00:53:05,750
I'm about to sprint.

1480
00:53:08,970 --> 00:53:10,050
(She does not know when to give up)

1481
00:53:11,850 --> 00:53:12,810
(Wang Anyu out)

1482
00:53:12,850 --> 00:53:14,090
(Caught off guard)

1483
00:53:16,730 --> 00:53:19,090
(He is finally ambushed)

1484
00:53:24,130 --> 00:53:26,810
(Look into my eyes)

1485
00:53:26,830 --> 00:53:28,950
You lost because you let
your guard down.

1486
00:53:30,150 --> 00:53:31,030
All is fair in war.

1487
00:53:31,030 --> 00:53:32,210
(I learned it from you)

1488
00:53:34,370 --> 00:53:35,970
(I still have much to learn
about strategy)

1489
00:53:37,110 --> 00:53:37,950
Will you pick it up, or...

1490
00:53:37,950 --> 00:53:38,990
How about we form an alliance?

1491
00:53:41,350 --> 00:53:42,830
How can we form a team
with just two of us?

1492
00:53:42,830 --> 00:53:44,510
Why form an alliance
when it's just the two of you?

1493
00:53:45,030 --> 00:53:46,550
The real rivalry begins now.

1494
00:53:46,550 --> 00:53:47,710
Let's settle this at the table.

1495
00:53:48,470 --> 00:53:49,030
Sounds good.

1496
00:53:49,030 --> 00:53:50,750
It'll be a fairer fight at the table.

1497
00:53:50,970 --> 00:53:52,970
(The final showdown)

1498
00:53:54,830 --> 00:53:56,430
Shall we use these two fingers?

1499
00:53:56,430 --> 00:53:56,910
Sure.

1500
00:53:57,750 --> 00:53:58,830
I can imagine what will happen

1501
00:53:58,830 --> 00:54:00,670
when she moves her other hand...

1502
00:54:00,670 --> 00:54:02,110
I will fear she has a third hand
hidden away.

1503
00:54:03,370 --> 00:54:04,650
(Trust has hit rock bottom)

1504
00:54:07,050 --> 00:54:08,170
(Just as expected)

1505
00:54:09,830 --> 00:54:10,910
This hand is...

1506
00:54:11,310 --> 00:54:12,190
All is fair in war.

1507
00:54:12,710 --> 00:54:14,190
That's what we call
a clever move, darling.

1508
00:54:14,250 --> 00:54:15,510
(What a clever move)

1509
00:54:15,510 --> 00:54:16,310
It is my glove.

1510
00:54:16,310 --> 00:54:17,230
(The glove has a mind of its own)

1511
00:54:17,230 --> 00:54:18,550
"It is my glove".

1512
00:54:19,270 --> 00:54:20,350
Over here.

1513
00:54:20,350 --> 00:54:21,030
There is a camera here.

1514
00:54:21,030 --> 00:54:22,670
(Find an excuse to get closer)
There was no camera over there.

1515
00:54:22,710 --> 00:54:23,670
Churan, you get three times

1516
00:54:23,670 --> 00:54:24,710
the screen time I do.

1517
00:54:26,030 --> 00:54:27,350
You really know how to work the camera.

1518
00:54:32,250 --> 00:54:34,090
(A woodpecker-style attack)

1519
00:54:46,390 --> 00:54:47,430
These two

1520
00:54:47,430 --> 00:54:47,910
are pure determination.

1521
00:54:48,250 --> 00:54:49,730
(A temporary truce)

1522
00:54:50,730 --> 00:54:53,730
(Winning decisively, leaving gracefully)

1523
00:54:54,030 --> 00:54:55,710
Would you not have spared me earlier?

1524
00:54:55,710 --> 00:54:56,790
Then it would have ended long ago.

1525
00:54:57,190 --> 00:54:58,910
Yes, you are capable of doing that.

1526
00:54:58,910 --> 00:54:59,790
I would never do that.

1527
00:55:00,290 --> 00:55:02,370
(Gentleman)

1528
00:55:02,590 --> 00:55:03,870
I would have surrendered.

1529
00:55:09,910 --> 00:55:10,670
She is strong.

1530
00:55:10,690 --> 00:55:12,130
(Bai Jingting out)

1531
00:55:13,910 --> 00:55:14,590
All right.

1532
00:55:14,590 --> 00:55:16,470
Congratulations to Churan
on her victory.

1533
00:55:16,470 --> 00:55:17,790
No, Bai went easy on me.

1534
00:55:17,790 --> 00:55:19,070
I kept pressing down

1535
00:55:19,070 --> 00:55:21,110
with these two fingers.

1536
00:55:22,190 --> 00:55:23,190
It's getting a little numb.

1537
00:55:23,750 --> 00:55:24,710
I need to switch fingers.

1538
00:55:24,870 --> 00:55:25,750
I will switch fingers too.

1539
00:55:25,750 --> 00:55:26,630
I cannot take it anymore.

1540
00:55:26,750 --> 00:55:27,510
My finger's bent so far

1541
00:55:27,910 --> 00:55:29,270
now that I can't straighten it.

1542
00:55:29,270 --> 00:55:29,970
(Blood rushing to the finger)

1543
00:55:31,270 --> 00:55:32,270
Got a nail?

1544
00:55:33,470 --> 00:55:34,270
I will hammer it in here.

1545
00:55:35,990 --> 00:55:36,910
I need some screen time.

1546
00:55:39,190 --> 00:55:40,510
Churan has rubbed off on me.

1547
00:55:41,130 --> 00:55:42,710
(Human nature)

1548
00:55:42,710 --> 00:55:43,710
Can the magnification effect

1549
00:55:43,710 --> 00:55:45,310
give us an extra finger?

1550
00:55:45,310 --> 00:55:46,150
Are three fingers allowed?

1551
00:55:46,150 --> 00:55:47,630
Actually, three could work too.

1552
00:55:47,630 --> 00:55:49,550
For example, I could increase my chances

1553
00:55:49,550 --> 00:55:50,910
by using three fingers.

1554
00:55:50,910 --> 00:55:51,270
Exactly.

1555
00:55:51,670 --> 00:55:53,390
We can use an extra finger
without telling anyone.

1556
00:55:53,390 --> 00:55:54,150
(A few tricks)
What do you think?

1557
00:55:54,150 --> 00:55:55,230
Let's play fair.

1558
00:55:55,230 --> 00:55:56,590
We just need to hide the extra finger.

1559
00:55:56,610 --> 00:55:57,690
(Someone's always one step ahead)

1560
00:55:59,150 --> 00:56:00,870
I never saw that coming.

1561
00:56:05,190 --> 00:56:06,110
Come on, everyone.

1562
00:56:06,110 --> 00:56:07,510
Back to the table.

1563
00:56:07,510 --> 00:56:09,230
Everyone, use two fingers.

1564
00:56:09,750 --> 00:56:11,390
(Two-Finger Chase: Round Two)
Three, two, one.

1565
00:56:11,390 --> 00:56:12,030
Begin.

1566
00:56:21,410 --> 00:56:22,970
(Defending with all his might)

1567
00:56:22,990 --> 00:56:23,830
An hour later...

1568
00:56:25,770 --> 00:56:27,210
(Thinking hard)

1569
00:56:30,330 --> 00:56:31,570
(Look at him)

1570
00:56:31,570 --> 00:56:34,010
(Bai Jingting's point of view)

1571
00:56:37,010 --> 00:56:39,450
(Bai Jingting out)

1572
00:56:43,150 --> 00:56:44,350
60 seconds.

1573
00:56:44,350 --> 00:56:45,710
(Only one person can be eliminated
in 60 seconds)

1574
00:56:45,710 --> 00:56:48,470
Bing is out for blood this round.

1575
00:56:48,470 --> 00:56:49,110
What a fierce attack.

1576
00:56:49,670 --> 00:56:50,470
That is terrifying.

1577
00:56:51,150 --> 00:56:52,430
(On a rampage)
It is getting crowded here, Bai.

1578
00:56:53,690 --> 00:56:54,970
(Quite the bold move)

1579
00:56:55,230 --> 00:56:57,110
Bai and I hadn't
even finished making that face.

1580
00:57:04,590 --> 00:57:05,950
This round is getting intense.

1581
00:57:06,990 --> 00:57:09,390
(Keeping his distance)
We should keep our distance from Bing.

1582
00:57:09,750 --> 00:57:10,630
I will move over there.

1583
00:57:13,030 --> 00:57:13,750
Bing.

1584
00:57:16,470 --> 00:57:17,470
Stay away from the battlefield.

1585
00:57:19,330 --> 00:57:21,570
(Huang Jingyu's point of view)

1586
00:57:21,630 --> 00:57:22,970
(Acting cute)
Do not touch me.

1587
00:57:23,090 --> 00:57:24,370
(What is this?)

1588
00:57:25,190 --> 00:57:26,470
I am ticklish.

1589
00:57:26,750 --> 00:57:27,270
Really?

1590
00:57:27,270 --> 00:57:28,810
(That gives him an idea)

1591
00:57:39,010 --> 00:57:40,850
(Jia Bing out)

1592
00:57:41,190 --> 00:57:42,750
You can eliminate people like that?

1593
00:57:42,750 --> 00:57:44,570
(Disarming his opponent with cuteness)
Why do you have to target me?

1594
00:57:44,690 --> 00:57:46,050
(In that case...)

1595
00:57:47,070 --> 00:57:47,790
Together, we are a flame.

1596
00:57:47,790 --> 00:57:48,630
Apart, we are stars.

1597
00:57:49,030 --> 00:57:49,790
I am leaving.

1598
00:57:54,510 --> 00:57:55,230
What was it called again?

1599
00:57:55,230 --> 00:57:56,270
Odds Booster.

1600
00:57:57,970 --> 00:57:58,850
(Watching the commotion)

1601
00:58:01,290 --> 00:58:02,410
(Pretending to be busy)

1602
00:58:03,170 --> 00:58:04,690
(You cannot see me)

1603
00:58:04,730 --> 00:58:06,250
(Please do not choose me)

1604
00:58:07,430 --> 00:58:08,590
Take one of Wang Anyu's fingers away.

1605
00:58:11,270 --> 00:58:12,670
Do you finally admit I'm too strong?

1606
00:58:12,850 --> 00:58:14,210
(Not worth arguing with)

1607
00:58:14,630 --> 00:58:15,950
You are very good
at comforting yourself.

1608
00:58:15,950 --> 00:58:17,350
You take fingers from me,
but not Mr. Huang.

1609
00:58:17,350 --> 00:58:18,270
It is fine.

1610
00:58:18,270 --> 00:58:19,510
What difference does one finger make?

1611
00:58:19,690 --> 00:58:20,890
(Holding on through sheer stubbornness)

1612
00:58:22,270 --> 00:58:22,750
I think we should

1613
00:58:22,750 --> 00:58:24,230
show Churan some respect this round.

1614
00:58:24,250 --> 00:58:25,370
(He is coming for me)

1615
00:58:25,430 --> 00:58:26,350
You go show her some respect.

1616
00:58:27,510 --> 00:58:28,710
Go on, show her some respect.

1617
00:58:28,710 --> 00:58:30,230
I want to see you show
Churan some serious respect.

1618
00:58:31,350 --> 00:58:32,230
Give it a try.

1619
00:58:32,230 --> 00:58:33,370
(Not afraid at all)

1620
00:58:35,170 --> 00:58:37,010
(Enjoying the show)

1621
00:58:37,790 --> 00:58:39,270
Now that you mention it, I am scared.

1622
00:58:55,090 --> 00:58:56,970
(One more person joins the pursuit)

1623
